flowchart TD
    GATE[sensitive action] --> TOKEN{verdict obtained?}
    TOKEN -->|yes| VERIFY[server verify signature + nonce]
    VERIFY --> RISK{risk}
    RISK -->|good| ALLOW[allow]
    RISK -->|degraded| STEP[step-up / limit]
    RISK -->|bad| BLOCK[block]
    TOKEN -->|no Play Services/offline| FALLBACK[fallback policy by value]
